{
  "sn10.12:0.1": "Linked Discourses 10.12 ",
  "sn10.12:0.2": "1. With Indaka ",
  "sn10.12:0.3": "With Āḷavaka ",
  "sn10.12:1.1": "So I have heard. ",
  "sn10.12:1.2": "At one time the Buddha was staying near Āḷavī in the haunt of the native spirit Āḷavaka. ",
  "sn10.12:1.3": "Then the native spirit Āḷavaka went up to the Buddha, and said to him: ",
  "sn10.12:1.4": "“Get out, ascetic!” ",
  "sn10.12:1.5": "Saying, “All right, respectable sir,” the Buddha went out. ",
  "sn10.12:1.6": "“Get in, ascetic!” ",
  "sn10.12:1.7": "Saying, “All right, respectable sir,” the Buddha went in. ",
  "sn10.12:1.8": "And for a second time the native spirit Āḷavaka said to the Buddha, ",
  "sn10.12:1.9": "“Get out, ascetic!” ",
  "sn10.12:1.10": "Saying, “All right, respectable sir,” the Buddha went out. ",
  "sn10.12:1.11": "“Get in, ascetic!” ",
  "sn10.12:1.12": "Saying, “All right, respectable sir,” the Buddha went in. ",
  "sn10.12:1.13": "And for a third time the native spirit Āḷavaka said to the Buddha, ",
  "sn10.12:1.14": "“Get out, ascetic!” ",
  "sn10.12:1.15": "Saying, “All right, respectable sir,” the Buddha went out. ",
  "sn10.12:1.16": "“Get in, ascetic!” ",
  "sn10.12:1.17": "Saying, “All right, respectable sir,” the Buddha went in. ",
  "sn10.12:1.18": "And for a fourth time the native spirit Āḷavaka said to the Buddha, ",
  "sn10.12:1.19": "“Get out, ascetic!” ",
  "sn10.12:1.20": "“No, respectable sir, I won’t get out. ",
  "